            "line": 588,
            "text": "theorem finalAngular_uniform (d : TailData) (eta : ℝ) {y : ℝ}\n    (hy : d.flattenEnd ≤ y) :\n    finalAngular d (y, eta) = carrier d y * (tailShape d (y - tailStart d) / (1 - d.rho))"
